	<p style="htitle">Potteries</p>
	<p style="hp">A pottery uses ore, coal and labor to make goods. Put it within reach of a staffed market that supplies those inputs and accepts finished goods, or connect it to freight transport.</p>
	<p style="hp">You can tell when potteries are working by the kilns producing smoke.</p>

  <p style="hp">This is a pottery</p>
   <img src="images/help-art01/Pottery.png" halign="center"/>

  <p style="hp">and this its icon</p>
   <img src="images/help-art01/Pottery-icon.png" halign="center"/>

	<p style="hsubtitle">Formulas</p>
	<p style="hp">11 ore + 2 coal + 35 labor =&gt; 35 goods</p>

